title: Search in every file: with results, with none, with odd characters, an empty one; go to file and the command palette
folders: git-history
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
search step_1
wait 1200
mark results
wait 500
ui click 200 204
wait 1200
mark result-clicked
wait 500
search zzz_nothing_has_this
wait 1000
mark none
wait 500
search {} {}", steps::
wait 1000
mark odd-characters
wait 500
search (
wait 1000
mark paren
wait 500
search \
wait 800
mark backslash
wait 500
search n
wait 1200
mark many
wait 500
search
wait 800
mark empty-query
wait 500
quick stps
wait 800
mark quick
wait 500
ui click 900 700
wait 400
quick zzzz
wait 700
mark quick-none
wait 500
ui click 900 700
wait 400
palette theme
wait 800
mark palette
wait 500
ui click 900 700
wait 400
palette zzzz
wait 700
mark palette-none
wait 500
ui click 900 700
wait 400
quit
